Performance text uses the valuation commodity's declared precision for its opening value.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight investment-performance --accounts Assets:Cash --from 2024-01-02 --to 2024-01-02

========== FILE ==========

commodity EUR
  default
  format 1,000.000 EUR
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Cash  1234.5678 EUR
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

Investment performance from 2024-01-02 to 2024-01-02
Instruments: 1
Opening value: 1,234.568 EUR
Net contributions: 0.000 EUR
Ending value: 1,234.568 EUR
Profit/loss: 0.000 EUR
Time-weighted return: n/a
Money-weighted return (total): n/a
Money-weighted return (annualized): n/a

========== WARNINGS ==========
